  "prefLabel": "He-C 5004.10 Prior Authorization",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 5004.10 Prior Authorization. Telehealth services, including teledentistry, shall be subject to the same prior authorization requirements as services delivered via face to face.\n\nSource. #13651, eff 5-26-23",
